================================================================================
BeexWrite web editor bundle (Write/wwwroot)
================================================================================

The Markdown editor is a pre-built web bundle embedded into the application and
rendered via WebView2. It incorporates the following third-party open-source
libraries (all permissive licenses); refer to each project for full terms:

  * KaTeX — MIT — https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX
  * Mermaid — MIT — https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
  * CodeMirror (editor + language modes) — MIT — https://github.com/codemirror
  * Cytoscape.js — MIT — https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape.js
  * dagre — MIT — https://github.com/dagrejs/dagre
  * D3 — ISC / BSD-3-Clause — https://github.com/d3
  * js-yaml — MIT — https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml
  * viz.js — MIT (bundles Graphviz, EPL-1.0) — https://github.com/mdaines/viz-js

This list covers the major libraries identified in the build output; the bundle
may include additional transitive dependencies under similar permissive licenses.

================================================================================
OCR component (separate process — NOT linked into the main application)
================================================================================

Optical character recognition, formula and table recognition are provided by a
standalone sidecar executable (BeeX_OCR.exe / BeeX_Formula.exe) that is built
from a separate project and installed on demand at runtime. The main application
communicates with it only over an inter-process line protocol (stdin/stdout) and
does NOT reference or link any of the packages below. They are listed here for
transparency; their terms apply only to the separately distributed OCR sidecar.

  * Sdcb.PaddleOCR / Sdcb.PaddleInference 3.3.x (PaddleSharp)
      License: Apache-2.0
      Copyright (c) sdcb (Zhou Jie) and contributors
      https://github.com/sdcb/PaddleSharp

  * OpenCvSharp4 (runtime.win)
      License: Apache-2.0
      Copyright (c) shimat and contributors
      https://github.com/shimat/opencvsharp

  * PaddlePaddle / PaddleOCR (upstream inference engine and models)
      License: Apache-2.0
      Copyright (c) PaddlePaddle Authors (Baidu)
      https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR

